{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Two similar pictures? Only at first glance! \ud83c\udfc6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot the differences faster than your opponent and prove who\u2019s the real observation master. You'll face levels of varying difficulty with 5\u201310 differences, vibrant images, and easy zoom controls. Stuck? Use a hint - but remember, your opponent won\u2019t wait!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae No Time Limits, Just Pure Challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no timer in Differences Online, but that doesn\u2019t mean you can relax. Each round is a duel of perception, where the first to find all the differences wins. Play online against real players, prove your observation skills, and climb the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/14fe10389de5a0a0adba7f007384894c.poster.avif?t=1766157678\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/14fe10389de5a0a0adba7f007384894c.webm?t=1766157678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/14fe10389de5a0a0adba7f007384894c.mp4?t=1766157678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Discover New Locations!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new themed picture sets. Explore different game settings, enjoy beautifully crafted scenes, and sharpen your skills with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/ff23058bd8d2fc00a0c518c09727b3a2.poster.avif?t=1766157678\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/ff23058bd8d2fc00a0c518c09727b3a2.webm?t=1766157678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/ff23058bd8d2fc00a0c518c09727b3a2.mp4?t=1766157678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Train Your Mind &amp; Relax at the Same Time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is perfect for improving focus or simply winding down after a long day. No stress, just a fun and engaging experience that helps you concentrate and enjoy the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/ab55aada3bbf6aac3b065bc4f3f63463.poster.avif?t=1766157678\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/ab55aada3bbf6aac3b065bc4f3f63463.webm?t=1766157678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462600/extras/ab55aada3bbf6aac3b065bc4f3f63463.mp4?t=1766157678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to test your observation skills? Jump into Differences Online and prove you have the sharpest eye!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Flowers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462600/6d4b8a55504bc47a3b4986cffe7ef8419cfc30d9.jpg"},{"name":"Sweets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462600/2ac4eafa9f9e3565e368fc1336c9300a2010b378.jpg"},{"name":"China","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3462600/56a48204c4310d6465a1d0960bf0